---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"The Choice Point Tool | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Discover The Choice Point at Tangible Mental Health Provo. Track towards & away moves daily, clarify emotions, and take mindful action for self-improvement."}>
<section class="sec t-white h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:26">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/3/15/13;--m:1/2/10/10"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-763b71.jpeg" alt="Close-up of lush green, ribbed leaves with some minor damage and spots." width="2000" height="2500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/16/8/24;--m:12/2/19/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p><br/><span class="c-darkAccent">The Choice Point is a simple, yet powerful tool for self-improvement. It can help you build your ideal self by clarifying what’s most important to you, what you’d like to avoid, and how to mindfully build the life you want through meaningful action.</span></p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:6/5/17/11;--m:3/4/11/8;--dz:3;--mz:3"><figure class="img fill"><img src="/images/image-asset-d0eee0.jpeg" alt="Empty white background with slightly textured surface." width="1765" height="2500" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-embed" style="--d:9/17/16/24;--m:19/2/27/10;--dz:5;--mz:5"><div>
<iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" frameborder="0" height="240" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/OV15x8LvwAQ?si=n2Q21_4PZqdc9DTc" title="YouTube video player" width="380"></iframe>
</div>
<style is:inline class="transform-overrides-vars">
</style></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:10/5/15/11;--m:6/4/10/8;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">The Choice Point</span></h2></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-white h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:10">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:1/8/17/20;--m:3/2/9/10"><figure class="img fill" style="--fit:contain"><img src="/images/choice-point-c94998.png" alt="Diagram showing two arrows diverging from a central orange circle labeled &#x27;Choice Point&#x27;. The left arrow is red, pointing away and labeled &#x27;HOKED&#x27;, indicating a negative response when feelings are &#x27;Away&#x27; from the situation. The right arrow is green, pointing towards and labeled &#x27;UNHOOKED&#x27;, indicating a positive response when feelings are &#x27;Towards&#x27; the situation. The diagram is titled &#x27;Situations, Thoughts &amp; Feelings&#x27;." width="1132" height="1254" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/15/7;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-darkAccent">Take the time each day to track your towards and away moves. Pay close attention to your feelings and journal your thoughts each day. Remember that we all make away moves every day and that's okay. When it comes to away moves ask yourself the following questions:</span></p><ol><li><p><span class="c-darkAccent">How do I feel before and after making this away move?</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-darkAccent">What emotions consistently pull me into away moves?</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-darkAccent">How can I unhook and change my relationship with that emotion? (ie. Making Space)</span></p></li></ol></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/21/15/26;--m:9/2/11/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p><span class="c-darkAccent">After you’ve taken time to clarify your away moves, it’s important to understand what are you moving towards. Ask yourself the following questions:</span></p><ol><li><p><span class="c-darkAccent">What are the towards moves that I’m already making in my life?</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-darkAccent">How do I know when I’m making a towards move? What am I measuring against?</span></p></li><li><p><span class="c-darkAccent">What does it feel like before, during, and after making a towards move?</span></p></li></ol></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
